<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA. [CORRECTED 17:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS HOGS STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA. [CORRECTED 17:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 higher. Trading moderately active. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.00-55.50, mostly 55.50</p>
<p>		 near 200 hd 57.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.00-52.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs steady-0.25 higher;  450-500 lbs scarce; 500-650 lbs steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.75 (corrects from 45.50-45.75)</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    Scarce</p>
<p>	    500-550 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
<p>	    550-650 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
</text>
